## 📋 PowerShell CMDLETS (вместо Unix команд)

| Unix команда | PowerShell аналог | Пример |
|--------------|-------------------|--------|
| `grep` | `Select-String` | `... \| Select-String "pattern"` |
| `grep -v` | `Select-String -NotMatch` | `... \| Select-String -NotMatch "pattern"` |
| `awk '{print $1}'` | `ForEach-Object` | `... \| ForEach-Object { $_.Split()[0] }` |
| `wc -l` | `Measure-Object -Line` | `... \| Measure-Object -Line` |
| `cat file` | `Get-Content file` | `Get-Content .\file.yaml` |
| `head -n 10` | `Select-Object -First 10` | `... \| Select-Object -First 10` |
| `tail -n 10` | `Select-Object -Last 10` | `... \| Select-Object -Last 10` |
| `ls` | `Get-ChildItem` или `dir` | `Get-ChildItem .\k8s\` |
| `find` | `Get-ChildItem -Recurse` | `Get-ChildItem -Recurse -Filter *.yaml` |

